<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Amazon 商品情报周报 · {{ run.snapshot_date }}</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --paper: #f6f3ec;
    --surface: #ffffff;
    --ink: #101b2d;
    --muted: #5a6678;
    --line: #e2dccf;
    --teal: #0e766e;
    --teal-soft: #e4f1ef;
    --amber: #a85a12;
    --amber-soft: #f9eedf;
    --red: #b3261e;
    --red-soft: #f9e7e5;
    --shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(16, 27, 45, .04), 0 18px 40px -30px rgba(16, 27, 45, .45);
    --sans: "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", "Noto Sans SC", "Segoe UI", system-ui, sans-serif;
    --mono: "Cascadia Code", "SFMono-Regular", Consolas, monospace;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  .wrap { max-width: 1160px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 26px 20px 48px; }
  .hero {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding-bottom: 18px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    gap: 16px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .hero h1 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.8rem); letter-spacing: -.03em; }
  .hero p { margin: 4px 0 0; color: var(--muted); }
  .hero .badges { margin-left: auto; display: flex; gap: 6px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .badge {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 24px; padding: 0 9px;
    border-radius: 999px; font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 700;
    border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--surface); color: var(--muted);
  }
  .badge.teal { background: var(--teal-soft); color: var(--teal); border-color: #bcded9; }
  .badge.amber { background: var(--amber-soft); color: var(--amber); border-color: #ecd2b2; }
  .badge.red { background: var(--red-soft); color: var(--red); border-color: #efc9c5; }
  .kpis {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(5, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 10px;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
  }
  .kpi {
    background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 10px 12px; box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }
  .kpi b { display: block; font-size: 1.35rem; font-family: var(--mono); }
  .kpi span { color: var(--muted); font-size: .72rem; }
  .signals { margin: 0 0 20px; }
  .signals h2 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: .95rem; }
  .signal-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 10px; }
  .signal {
    background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-left: 4px solid var(--teal);
    border-radius: 10px; padding: 9px 12px; box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }
  .signal.high { border-left-color: var(--red); }
  .signal.medium { border-left-color: var(--amber); }
  .signal.low { border-left-color: var(--teal); }
  .signal p { margin: 5px 0 3px; font-size: .8rem; }
  .signal small { color: var(--muted); font-size: .7rem; }
  .signal .badge { min-height: 20px; padding: 0 7px; font-size: .66rem; }
  .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 14px; }
  .card {
    background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 14px 16px; box-shadow: var(--shadow); overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  .card h2 { margin: 0 0 2px; font-size: 1.05rem; }
  .card .meta { color: var(--muted); font-size: .72rem; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .card .meta a { color: var(--teal); text-decoration: none; }
  .card .status { float: right; }
  .thumb {
    display: block; width: 100%; height: 180px; object-fit: contain;
    background: #fbfaf7; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px;
    margin: 4px 0 10px; padding: 6px;
  }
  .bullets { margin: 0; padding-left: 18px; font-size: .8rem; }
  .bullets li { margin: 3px 0; }
  .snapshot {
    width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: .78rem; margin: 8px 0 10px;
  }
  .snapshot th, .snapshot td { border: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 5px 7px; text-align: left; }
  .snapshot th { background: var(--teal-soft); width: 34%; }
  .section { margin-top: 10px; }
  .section h3 { margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: .82rem; color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: .04em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .section p { margin: 0 0 4px; }
  .section ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 18px; }
  .section li { margin: 2px 0; }
  .gaps { margin-top: 8px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px; }
  .gaps span { background: var(--amber-soft); color: var(--amber); border: 1px solid #ecd2b2; border-radius: 999px; padding: 1px 8px; font-size: .7rem; }
  .confidence { font-size: .72rem; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 8px; }
  .failed { border-left: 4px solid var(--red); }
  .skipped { border-left: 4px solid var(--amber); }
  .success { border-left: 4px solid var(--teal); }
  .failures { margin-top: 24px; }
  .failure {
    background: var(--red-soft); border: 1px solid #efc9c5; border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 10px 12px; margin: 8px 0; color: var(--red); font-size: .82rem;
  }
  .note {
    margin-top: 26px; padding: 12px 14px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    color: var(--muted); font-size: .75rem;
  }
  code { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: .85em; }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .kpis { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
    .signal-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
  @media print {
    body { background: #fff; }
    .card, .kpi { box-shadow: none; break-inside: avoid; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
  <header class="hero">
    <div>
      <h1>Amazon 商品情报周报</h1>
      <p>{{ run.snapshot_date }} · 运行 {{ run.run_id[:8] }} · 用时 {{ "%.0f"|format(run.duration_ms) }} ms</p>
    </div>
    <div class="badges">
      <span class="badge teal">{{ source_label }}</span>
      <span class="badge">amazon.com</span>
      <span class="badge">低频采集 · 非生产</span>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="kpis" aria-label="运行统计">
    <div class="kpi"><b>{{ run.total }}</b><span>商品总数</span></div>
    <div class="kpi"><b>{{ run.success }}</b><span>成功</span></div>
    <div class="kpi"><b>{{ run.skipped }}</b><span>跳过</span></div>
    <div class="kpi"><b>{{ run.failed }}</b><span>失败</span></div>
    <div class="kpi"><b>{{ run.blocked }}</b><span>被拦截</span></div>
    <div class="kpi"><b>{{ run.cache_hits }}</b><span>缓存命中</span></div>
    <div class="kpi"><b>{{ "%.0f"|format(run.duration_ms) }}</b><span>耗时 ms</span></div>
  </section>

  {% if signals %}
  <section class="signals" aria-label="本周信号">
    <h2>本周信号</h2>
    <div class="signal-grid">
      {% for signal in signals %}
      <article class="signal {{ signal.severity }}">
        <span class="badge {% if signal.severity == 'high' %}red{% elif signal.severity == 'medium' %}amber{% else %}teal{% endif %}">{{ signal.severity_label }}</span>
        <p>{{ signal.text }}</p>
        <small>{{ signal.evidence }}</small>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>
  {% endif %}

  <main class="grid">
    {% for product in products %}
    <article class="card {{ product.status }}">
      <span class="status badge {% if product.status == 'success' %}teal{% elif product.status == 'failed' %}red{% else %}amber{% endif %}">{{ product.status_label }}</span>
      <h2>{{ product.name }}</h2>
      <div class="meta">
        {{ product.category }} · <a href="{{ product.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">{{ product.product_id }}</a>
        · 历史 {{ product.history_count }} 次
        {% if product.source %} · 来源 {{ product.source }}{% endif %}
      </div>

      {% if product.main_image %}
      <img class="thumb" src="{{ product.main_image }}" alt="{{ product.name }}" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer">
      {% endif %}

      {% if product.snapshot %}
      <table class="snapshot">
        <tr><th>价格</th><td>{{ product.price_display }}</td></tr>
        <tr><th>List Price</th><td>{{ product.list_price_display }}</td></tr>
        <tr><th>星级</th><td>{{ product.rating_display }}</td></tr>
        <tr><th>评价数</th><td>{{ product.reviews_display }}</td></tr>
        <tr><th>预计销量</th><td>{{ product.sales_display }}</td></tr>
        <tr><th>库存</th><td>{{ product.stock_display }}</td></tr>
        <tr><th>卖家</th><td>{{ product.seller_display }}</td></tr>
        <tr><th>详情图</th><td>{{ product.gallery_count }} 张</td></tr>
      </table>
      {% endif %}

      {% if product.bullets %}
      <div class="section">
        <h3>产品简介</h3>
        <ul class="bullets">{% for item in product.bullets %}<li>{{ item }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
      </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if product.description and product.description != '—' %}
      <div class="section">
        <h3>产品描述</h3>
        <p>{{ product.description }}</p>
      </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if product.analysis %}
      <div class="section">
        <h3>摘要</h3>
        <p>{{ product.analysis.summary }}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="section">
        <h3>价格 / 销量</h3>
        <p>{{ product.analysis.price_trend }}</p>
        <p>{{ product.analysis.sales_trend }}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="section">
        <h3>关键变化</h3>
        <ul>{% for item in product.analysis.key_changes %}<li>{{ item }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
      </div>
      <div class="section">
        <h3>建议</h3>
        <ul>{% for item in product.analysis.actions %}<li>{{ item }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
      </div>
      <div class="confidence">置信度：{{ product.analysis.confidence }}</div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if product.error %}
      <div class="section">
        <h3>失败原因</h3>
        <p>{{ product.error }}</p>
      </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if product.data_gaps %}
      <div class="gaps">
        {% for gap in product.data_gaps %}<span>{{ gap }}</span>{% endfor %}
      </div>
      {% endif %}
    </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </main>

  {% if failures %}
  <section class="failures">
    <h2>失败与隔离</h2>
    {% for product in failures %}
    <div class="failure">
      <strong>{{ product.name }}</strong>：{{ product.error }}。其他商品继续处理，未中断本轮运行。
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </section>
  {% endif %}

  <p class="note">
    本报告来自 Amazon 公开商品详情页的低频采集；价格、销量、评价等字段以采集时页面为准，
    可能因地区、账号、卖家和时间而变化。价格可能来自 buybox 或第三方卖家，跨地区/卖家不可直接比较；
    销量是 K+/百+ 区间口径，不恢复精确值。默认使用 mock 分析，真实模型模式需要自行配置 API。
    报告不构成采购或投资建议，也不代表 Amazon 或品牌方立场。
  </p>
</div>
</body>
</html>
